        "**Q-learning**: learns a **Q-table** of values Q(s, a) for each state-action pair. Update (Bellman): `Q(s,a) ← Q(s,a) + α [ r + γ · max_a' Q(s',a') − Q(s,a) ]` (α learning rate, γ discount).",
